Hi,

I haven't tried with Bluez, but my MX900 works well with the Widcomm
stack.
After a full charge, left overnight, it lasts about a week.

A good way to test if it's Bluez, run the hub in HID mode i.e. don't
switch to HCI and see what the battery life is then.

Chris.


